{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわたん誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/22/1243761/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はチェキ会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週半分のメンバーは終わってて\n今週は残りの半分がチェキ会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/22/1243761/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各メンバー100名の方\nご当選おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/22/1243761/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん重複当選無かったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"椅子が２つ並んでて\nファンの方とメンバーそれぞれ\n座って撮る感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背景はアルバムのポスター貼ってありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの衣装は11th制服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーズはね多い順だと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマいか\nピース\nハート\nぷく顔\nダ！\n虫歯ポーズ\n春メロ\nぶりっ子\nヲタ芸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が複数人いらっしゃいましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アヒル口\n背中合わせ\nあっち向いてホイ！\nがうっち\n横から読むと\nおやぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうやる予定は当分無さそうな感じもするけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会好きだなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/22/1243761/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/22/1243761/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天や乃木坂のライブではお馴染みの\n早出さんから\nホワイトデーでいただいたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくない？乃木坂ぺろぺろキャンディ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺろぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}